<mxCell id="c30" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.25;color:#1F2A44&quot;&gt;Dò lỗi bằng luật cố định&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:17px;font-weight:normal;line-height:1.4;color:#1F2A44;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;59 quy tắc xác định chạy qua npx impeccable&lt;br&gt;detect hoặc hook khi agent sửa file giao diện:&lt;br&gt;Claude Code, Copilot, Codex báo sau khi sửa,&lt;br&gt;Grok Build báo khi dừng, Cursor chặn trước khi&lt;br&gt;ghi.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#CFF5EE;strokeColor=#0B1B3A;strokeWidth=3;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=22;spacingLeft=94;spacingRight=22;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="1583" width="520" height="199" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
